# A Battle Arcade singles challenge (decomp scripts_battle_arcade.s, frontier_scripts_battle_arcade.s): the single
# attendant, SINGLE, the party menu (PARTY_MENU_MODE_BATTLE_CASTLE: three Pokémon), the save before the challenge
# (both questions YES), the corridor and the battle room. The game board (battle_arcade/main.c): its panels turn over,
# the cursor runs, STOP is touched; the effect it lands on (drawn from the game's RNG: it differs by seed) acts on the
# battle; the first battle won, the party healed, then RETIRE (YES): the save on the loss (BattleArcade_SaveOnLoss:
# the latest and record streak 1), the lobby's goodbye.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 100 platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE platinum:MOVE_DRAGON_CLAW platinum:MOVE_FIRE_FANG platinum:MOVE_CRUNCH
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_METAGROSS 100 platinum:MOVE_METEOR_MASH platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE platinum:MOVE_ZEN_HEADBUTT platinum:MOVE_BULLET_PUNCH
party 2 platinum:SPECIES_SALAMENCE 100 platinum:MOVE_DRAGON_CLAW platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE platinum:MOVE_FLAMETHROWER platinum:MOVE_AERIAL_ACE
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_BATTLE_ARCADE 14 6 up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until menu 600
# SINGLE
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until app party 600
+2 screenshot arcade-party
+2 tap slot:0
+2 tap menu:0
+2 tap slot:1
+2 tap menu:0
+2 tap slot:2
+2 tap menu:0
+2 tap confirm
until app none 300
advance text
until yesno 600
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until yesno 600
+2 press a
+1 release a
+300 press a
+1 release a
+120 screenshot arcade-corridor
advance text 3000
until app arcade 3000
+20 screenshot arcade-board
until state app.button 0 600
+0 screenshot arcade-roulette
+37 tap stop
until app none 300
+0 screenshot arcade-effect
advance text 3000
until battle 3000
+0 screenshot arcade-battle
battle auto 20000
advance text 3000
until menu 3000
+0 screenshot arcade-after
# RETIRE (the list's fourth)
+10 press down
+1 release down
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
until yesno 600
+2 press up
+1 release up
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
until idle 3000
advance text 3000
+0 assert battles frontier 1
+0 assert battle frontier * won single
+0 assert state frontier.arcade.streaks[0] {"record":1,"latest":1}
+0 assert state frontier.arcade.active[0] false
